---
description: Naming conventions
alwaysApply: true
---

Under 7 words per identifier. Full English words only.

No abbreviations. No clipped coinages (`needsReack` → `needsReapproval`). Spell the word (`reapproval`, `configuration`, `identifier`) — do not invent a shorter stem.

| Kind | Pattern |
|------|---------|
| Feature folder | `{entity}-{objective}` (`brand-browse`, `tenant-create`, `plugin-browse`) |
| Browse page | `{Entity}BrowsePage` |
| Detail page | `{Entity}DetailPage` |
| Phase page | `{Entity}{Phase}Page` |
| Server read | `get{Entity}Server` / `get{Entities}Server` |
| Client read | `get{Entity}Client` |
| Mutations | `create{Entity}`, `update{Entity}` |
| Model | `{entity}-schema.ts` |
| Form controller | `use{Entity}FormController` |
| List controller | `{Entity}ListController` |

Canonical product nouns: **tenant** (not organisation), **plugin** (not integration). Operations stay operations.

Forbidden: `CampaignListPage`, `GetCampaigns`, verb-leading feature folders (`create-brand`, `get-builds`). Use noun-first (`brand-create`).
